{
    "reasoner_response": "Begin by acknowledging the customer’s vehicle: "I can see you have a 2019 TOYOTA CAMRY on file." Let the customer know that for repairs under their contract, the repair facility—not the customer—must contact Assurant to initiate and authorize the claim before any repairs begin. Recommend starting with their selling dealer, Texas Auto Group, who can be reached at 214-555-0100, as they are familiar with the contract and can work directly with Assurant. Ask: "Would you like me to walk you through the steps to get the claim started?" Call me back with their answer for further instructions.",
    "communication_rules": [
        "- If the customer tried to change the topic while you are waiting for Supervisor instructions, before following any Reasoner's instructions, ask the customer whether they want to switch to the new topic or continue with the current one.",
        "- If any previous requests were prevented from execution, they can now be re-evaluated and executed if appropriate. Make a new function/tool request to do so."
    ]
}
